      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ATHLETE TICK (8) was prominent throughout when winning in the fastest time of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 7 lengths at this track (22.13). Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Better than last start and worth following up. TOUGH ENOUGH (3) has a strong record here with six wins and five placings from 17 starts. Comes off a (21.62) win last time, scoring by 6 lengths in a Mix 5 over 390m at this track. Looks well placed here and among the chances. UNREAL SPEED (2) last raced on June 14 when eighth (35.92) over 600m at Q Parklands in a Grade 5/6. Record off this box is sound. Expected to feature on best form. SHIMMERING REIGN (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
